# Ranger Landing's cache cave and Ranger Maya (CIPlay ranger_landing_caves, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as
# in its recipe (the island's frame, after the RESIZE push). The cache hatch in the den under the training hill is
# locked until someone talked to Ranger Maya at the camp's fire pit; her three answers (journal, the cache, goodbye);
# the walk in from the mouth at the hill's foot to the den's back and out again; the cache chest. Den floor ~4.9 m.
island Ranger Landing keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden rlcachechest

# The cave from outside, the walk in to the den's back
picture rl_cave_out 4 7.8 33 12 6.5 38
walk 9 36.3 to 12 38 to 24.6 45.3 to 33.9 50.6 to 36.5 52.1
picture rl_cave_in 22 6.8 44 36 6.2 52 light=20

# The cache hatch: locked before anyone talked to Maya
use rlcachedoor stay
expect message cache door is locked
expect shown rlcachedoor
expect hidden rlcachechest

# Ranger Maya at the camp, leaning on her crate
picture rl_islander -1.7 6 -50 -0.5 5.4 -46.6
use Ranger Maya
expect step 0

# Now the hatch opens on the cache chest
walk 33.9 50.6 to 36.5 52.1 below=8
use rlcachedoor stay
expect message rangers' cache
expect hidden rlcachedoor
expect shown rlcachechest
open Ranger cache
expect item Rope 3

# Her answers: 1 the mire (journal), 3 goodbye, 2 the cache
use Ranger Maya pick 1
expect message blight pools burn
use Ranger Maya pick 3
expect message river does not wait
use Ranger Maya pick 2
expect message under the lookout

# Out of the cave again past the mouth
walk 36.5 52.1 to 33.9 50.6 to 24.6 45.3 to 12 38 to 8 35.7 below=8
picture rl_cave_mouth_in 30 6.8 48.5 12 6 38 light=20
